From fdfec4247e102399b0f8df2c7e2a2a8002f655ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:24:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Store two successive sealed ordinary headers.

The first header is the sealed OP_TRUE payment. The second header is a
separate connect, seal, and commit that spends the coin the first block
created. Reopen returns the second header, its height, and the existing
BlockId, with that connect's UTXO root and monetary bytes. One undo of
the header, the monetary snapshot, and that block's UTXO commit restores
the first header. One more undo leaves the header file empty and the
parent seed. A failing second witness does not replace the stored
header. Nonce stays 0. This is two stored headers, not lotusd acceptance
and not ConnectTip.
---
 src/lotus_v2/test_block_seal_store.cpp | 483 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 476 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/lotus_v2/test_block_seal_store.cpp b/src/lotus_v2/test_block_seal_store.cpp
index e6536d5e3..6c903584f 100644
--- a/src/lotus_v2/test_block_seal_store.cpp
+++ b/src/lotus_v2/test_block_seal_store.cpp
@@ -1,8 +1,9 @@
